{"id":"995085b8741b47ae","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-time-complexity-notation.md","title":"73-df-time-complexity-notation — time complexity notation","display":"73-df-time-complexity-notation — time complexity notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-time-complexity-notation","display":"73-df-time-complexity-notation — time complexity notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]","[[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]","[[73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds]]","[[73-df-exact-clock-construction]]","[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]"],"aliases":["73-df-time-complexity-notation","73-definition-10.1"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-time-complexity-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-time-complexity-notation — time complexity notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9fa7db79fea5f29a\" href=\"?note=9fa7db79fea5f29a\" title=\"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8658210215541698\" href=\"?note=8658210215541698\" title=\"73-df-multitape-time-bounds\">73-df-multitape-time-bounds</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83a4535946978ce2\" href=\"?note=83a4535946978ce2\" title=\"73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds\">73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4aece652594d9d3c\" href=\"?note=4aece652594d9d3c\" title=\"73-df-exact-clock-construction\">73-df-exact-clock-construction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-time-complexity-notation</span><span>73-definition-10.1</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；本资源上下文的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9fa7db79fea5f29a\" href=\"?note=9fa7db79fea5f29a\" title=\"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics</a> 中满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\mathbf2}\">\\(\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\)</span> 的有限多带机，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span> 与其运行解释一致。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_M,\\mathsf{DTIME}\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_M,\\mathsf{DTIME}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8658210215541698\" href=\"?note=8658210215541698\" title=\"73-df-multitape-time-bounds\">73-df-multitape-time-bounds</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NTimeBound},\\mathsf{NTIME}\">\\(\\operatorname{NTimeBound},\\mathsf{NTIME}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"83a4535946978ce2\" href=\"?note=83a4535946978ce2\" title=\"73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds\">73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Steps}\">\\(\\mathrm{Steps}\\)</span> 是同一运行的部分步数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^+\">\\(T^+\\)</span> 是下述正值包络；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TIME}(T(n))\">\\(\\mathrm{TIME}(T(n))\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TIME}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{TIME}(T)\\)</span> 的函数表达式记法，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 不作为游离输入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeConstr}\">\\(\\mathrm{TimeConstr}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4aece652594d9d3c\" href=\"?note=4aece652594d9d3c\" title=\"73-df-exact-clock-construction\">73-df-exact-clock-construction</a> 的精确时钟构造谓词，记号由下式导入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选机器，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>；涉及某台机器代价的点值子句只在对应图含有该输入时调用。资源机全体若为类，则下面的图同样按有类型类缩写解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeBound}(M,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{TimeBound}(M,T)\\)</span> 是下述定义的二元精确时间界谓词，机器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 与函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为其两个参数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Steps}\\coloneqq\\{((M,w),r):M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\land r\\in\\mathbb N\\land(w,r)\\in\\operatorname{time}_M\\},\\qquad\nT^+(n)\\coloneqq\\max\\{1,T(n)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Steps}\\coloneqq\\{((M,w),r):M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\land r\\in\\mathbb N\\land(w,r)\\in\\operatorname{time}_M\\},\\qquad\nT^+(n)\\coloneqq\\max\\{1,T(n)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TimeBound}(M,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land\\bigl(\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(((M,w),r)\\in\\mathrm{Steps}\\land r\\le T(|w|))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TimeBound}(M,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land\\bigl(\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(((M,w),r)\\in\\mathrm{Steps}\\land r\\le T(|w|))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Steps}(M,\\cdot)\\in O(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;((M,w),r)\\in\\mathrm{Steps}\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(|w|\\ge n_0\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;(((M,w),r)\\in\\mathrm{Steps}\\land r\\le cT(|w|)))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Steps}(M,\\cdot)\\in O(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;((M,w),r)\\in\\mathrm{Steps}\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(|w|\\ge n_0\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;(((M,w),r)\\in\\mathrm{Steps}\\land r\\le cT(|w|)))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TIME}(T)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;(L=L(M)\\land\\mathrm{Steps}(M,\\cdot)\\in O(T))\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{NTIME}(T)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists N\\;(\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\mathbf2}(N)\\land L=L(N)\\land\\operatorname{NTimeBound}(N,T))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TIME}(T)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;(L=L(M)\\land\\mathrm{Steps}(M,\\cdot)\\in O(T))\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{NTIME}(T)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists N\\;(\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\mathbf2}(N)\\land L=L(N)\\land\\operatorname{NTimeBound}(N,T))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TimeConstr}\\coloneqq\\{t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}:\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}(t)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TimeConstr}\\coloneqq\\{t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}:\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}(t)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原来的并排文字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\ T(n)\">\\(M\\ T(n)\\)</span> 没有定义成任何关系；现在用 TimeBound 表达精确时限，TIME 仍采用最终大 O 时限而不改成精确时限类。NTimeBound 的显示公式在非负函数参数上同样有意义；多项式在零点为零不影响最终界，但所有短输入仍必须终止。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"9fa7db79fea5f29a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"8658210215541698","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nondeterministic-ti